{"page":181,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:34","surah":8,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَهُمْ أَلَّا يُعَذِّبَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَهُمْ يَصُدُّونَ عَنِ ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ وَمَا كَانُوٓا۟ أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ إِنْ أَوْلِيَآؤُهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"yet why should God not punish them when they debar people from the Sacred Mosque, although they are not its [rightful] guardians? Only those mindful of God are its rightful guardians, but most of the disbelievers do not realize this.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"But what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُعَذِّبَهُمُ","en_gloss":"(should) punish them","transliteration":"yuʿadhibahumu","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَصُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"hinder (people)","transliteration":"yaṣuddūna","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid","transliteration":"l-masjidi","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامِ","en_gloss":"Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"while not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"its guardians","transliteration":"awliyāahu","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not (can be)","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآؤُهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"its guardians","transliteration":"awliyāuhu","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"the ones who fear Allah","transliteration":"l-mutaqūna","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","en_gloss":"most of them","transliteration":"aktharahum","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"8:34"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:34"}]},{"verse_key":"8:35","surah":8,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كَانَ صَلَاتُهُمْ عِندَ ٱلْبَيْتِ إِلَّا مُكَآءً وَتَصْدِيَةً ۚ فَذُوقُوا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Their prayers before the House are nothing but whistling and clapping. ‘So taste the punishment for your disbelief.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَلَاتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their prayer","transliteration":"ṣalātuhum","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"at","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتِ","en_gloss":"the House","transliteration":"l-bayti","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُكَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"whistling","transliteration":"mukāan","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَصْدِيَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"and clapping","transliteration":"wataṣdiyatan","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So taste","transliteration":"fadhūqū","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurūna","verse_key":"8:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:35"}]},{"verse_key":"8:36","surah":8,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ لِيَصُدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ فَسَيُنفِقُونَهَا ثُمَّ تَكُونُ عَلَيْهِمْ حَسْرَةً ثُمَّ يُغْلَبُونَ ۗ وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ جَهَنَّمَ يُحْشَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They use their wealth to bar people from the path of God, and they will go on doing so. In the end this will be a source of intense regret for them: they will be overcome and herded towards Hell.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwālahum","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِيَصُدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"to hinder (people)","transliteration":"liyaṣuddū","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَسَيُنفِقُونَهَا","en_gloss":"So they will spend it","transliteration":"fasayunfiqūnahā","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"8:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَكُونُ","en_gloss":"it will be","translit